# Denylist template for the leak guard (scripts/check-no-proprietary.sh).
#
# Copy this file to ./.denylist (which is gitignored) and fill it with the naming stems of your
# real schema. One case-insensitive regex per line; blank lines and # comments are ignored.
# Keep the stems specific enough to avoid false positives on generic English words.
#
# Do NOT put your real stems in this example file — it is public. Put them only in ./.denylist.
#
# Example (generic placeholders — replace with your own):
# ACME_
# WIDGET_
# _INTERNALCODE
# SECRET_PROJECT
